diff --git a/changes/4417.misc.md b/changes/4417.misc.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..316816ec
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changes/4417.misc.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix `test_docstring_consistent_parameters`, which silently passed because it looked up a tuple of parameter names as a single key and concatenated two names into one. The test now checks every parameter documented by the `create_array` variants (`zarr.create_array`, `AsyncGroup.create_array`, `Group.create_array` and `Group.create`), and their docstrings were aligned: `shape`, `dtype`, `data`, `chunks`, `chunk_key_encoding`, `config` and `overwrite` now document the same types and text, `AsyncGroup.create_array` documents `data`, and typos in the chunk key encoding examples, the variable-length data type list and the Zarr format 2 default compressor description are corrected.
